STAGE CHALLENGE

Each stage has an objective from one of these five groups that must be completed.

{2}GET MICE {1}
To complete the level you must guide all the mice safely into the rocket.

{2}FEED CAT {1}
You must get the Kapus to eat all the mice on the level.

{2}50 MICE {1}
Get 50 mice into your rockets to complete this level

{2}CAT SOCCER {1}
Guide as many Kapus into your opponents rockets as possible to finish this level